      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"DomainClassConverter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.support\"><code>DomainClassConverter</code></a> for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a> 创建一个新的 <a href=\"DomainClassConverter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.support\"><code>DomainClassConverter</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
